      <title>效率倍增：Chrome “AI Skills” 深度评测——将复杂提示词转化为一键式生产力工具</title>
      <link>http://192.168.50.247:1313/insights/chrome-ai-skills--20260415011004538-0/</link>
      <pubDate>Wed, 15 Apr 2026 01:10:04 +0800</pubDate>
